# Cline/Claude Dev Workspace Rules

This repository uses structured Project Rules (`.cursor/rules/`) and Agent Skills (`.agents/skills/`).

Before executing any edits:
1. Refer to `.cursor/rules/` for global style guides matching the files you edit.
2. Read the `AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md` at the root for a full overview of the project setup and available skills.
3. If implementing CMS collections, React components, or MongoDB queries, load and follow the instructions in the corresponding `.agents/skills/` folders.
